  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img height=\"109\" src=\"assets\\st0311_39ec76a9c333.png\" width=\"91\" /><br /><br />Cyclic conjugation<br /><br />Lone pair involved in aromaticity<br /><br />Having <math><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mtext>&#960;</mtext><msup><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup></math> Aromatic<br /><br /><br /><img height=\"102\" src=\"assets\\st0311_a5459bae6d85.png\" width=\"90\" /><br /><br />Cyclic conjugation and by Huckel rule <math><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mtext>&#960;</mtext><msup><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup></math><br /><br />So aromatic<br /><br /><br /><img height=\"115\" src=\"assets\\st0311_54ceeb5d543e.png\" width=\"90\" /><br /><br />Cyclic conjugation <math><mn>6</mn><mtext>&#960;</mtext><msup><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup></math><br /><br />Cyclic conjugation lp of <math><mo>-</mo><mi>N</mi></math> is involved in delocalization<br /><br />Having <math><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mtext>&#960;</mtext><msup><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup></math> Aromatic<br /><br /><br /><img height=\"109\" src=\"assets\\st0311_ee2c26dc7784.png\" width=\"89\" /><br /><br />Cyclic conjugation and by Huckel rule <math><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mtext>&#960;</mtext><msup><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup></math><br /><br />So ,Anti-aromatic</p>"
